<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan King meets Saudi defence minister.</title>
<headline>Moroccan King meets Saudi defence minister.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>King Hassan of Morocco held talks with Saudi Defence Minister Prince Sultan Bin Abdul-Aziz on Friday, the Moroccan official RTM radio reported.</p>
<p>The meeting took place at the royal palace in the southern city of Marrakesh, RTM said, adding that the minister later left the country at the end of a brief short private visit.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
